    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675240/extras/7a98a3f9129aa010664aa155759a6b70.avif?t=1749537024\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eRoger That\u300f is a tactical battle royale game that immerses players in intense combat across war-torn battlegrounds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players become elite operatives with unique abilities, working closely with their squad through voice comms to strategize and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the operational zone rapidly shrinks, gathering weapons, gear, and intel becomes critical, demanding quick decision-making and tactical movement over sheer shooting skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features like real-time voice communication and drone reconnaissance add a new layer of strategy, shifting the tide of battle in an instant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining team-based gameplay with realistic combat elements, \u300eRoger That\u300f delivers a uniquely immersive and intense battle royale experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675240/extras/7a98a3f9129aa010664aa155759a6b70.avif?t=1749537024\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eRoger That\u300f is a tactical battle royale game that immerses players in intense combat across war-torn battlegrounds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players become elite operatives with unique abilities, working closely with their squad through voice comms to strategize and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the operational zone rapidly shrinks, gathering weapons, gear, and intel becomes critical, demanding quick decision-making and tactical movement over sheer shooting skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features like real-time voice communication and drone reconnaissance add a new layer of strategy, shifting the tide of battle in an instant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining team-based gameplay with realistic combat elements, \u300eRoger That\u300f delivers a uniquely immersive and intense battle royale experience.</p>",
